    \\/// A failure, or the cancellation it is.
    \\enum Failure[E] {
    \\    Failed(E) from
    \\    Cancelled(task::Cancelled) from
    \\} Failure
    \\
    \\/// Fails with `failure`, which arrives as `Failure.Cancelled` when it is a cancellation.
    \\fn raised[E](take failure: E) fails Failure[E] {
    \\    fail failure
    \\} raised
    \\
    \\/// How an entry failing with `failure` ended: cancelled when it is a cancellation, otherwise
    \\/// failed with its rendering.
    \\fn failed[E: Render](take failure: E, alloc: mem::Alloc) -> Ended {
